{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51210","headline":"五言白话诗 十七 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间日月明，皎皎照衆生。\n贵者乘车马，贱者膊胆行。\n富者前身种，贫者悭贪生。\n贫富有殊别，业报自相迎。\n闻强造功德，吃着自身荣。\n智者天上去，愚者入深坑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}